# Image builds use the repo root as context (uv.lock lives here). Allowlist: send nothing
# except what the Dockerfiles copy, so .env, .git, .venv and caches never reach Docker.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!services/

# Local leftovers inside services/
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.venv
